{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>Where is Abel your brother.</b> To enter with him in gentle words — perhaps he will relent and say: I killed him and sinned against You." "<b>I did not know.</b> He acted as one stealing the mind of the Most High." "<b>Am I my brother's keeper.</b> It is a term of astonishment; and so every heh pointed with a reduced patach."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:57:30.690528055Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}